  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Ox Baker Triumphant** (1 other source): The song has its own separate intro track before it, so there was spoken material beforehand [1]\n- **Thank You Mario But Our Princess Is In Another Castle** (1 other source): The song also has its own separate intro track before it, suggesting stage talk beforehand [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Fault Lines**: back after 135 archived shows (3757 days); rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **In The Shadow Of The Western Hills**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Alpha Gelida**: back after 155 archived shows (5558 days); rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Ox Baker Triumphant**: back after 29 archived shows (1173 days); rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Keeping House**: back after 28 archived shows (1105 days); rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Michael Myers Resplendent**: back after 37 archived shows (1295 days) [2]\n- **Slow West Voltures**: back after 38 archived shows (1321 days) [2]\n- **So Desperate**: back after 29 archived shows (1173 days) [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2012-06-22.aud.mp3** (recommended): audience recording; 20 songs; 90 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Ox Baker Triumphant, Thank You Mario But Our Princess Is In Another Castle [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2012-06-22.aud.mp3**: taped by WhosQuad; transferred by WhosQuad; source: AUD>Sandisk Sansa Internal Microphone>WAV [1]. Also: The file name marks this as an audience recording, distributed as mp3 and split into 23 tracks [1]",
